"{\"url\":\"https://maryzvolinskaya.wixsite.com/portfolio/uk/exposition2-0\",\"title\":\"exibition | Mattilda portfolio\",\"text\":\"Цей сайт створено у Wix. Розробіть свій уже сьогодні.\\nПочати\\n\\nфарба\\n\\nграфічний\\n\\nскульптура\\n\\nспівпраці\\n\\nis this reality?\\n\\nThe Series was made in Estonia in a personal Exhibition at the private Museum of Contemporary Art Kunsty in Vinnistu, during the period of forced transmigration. I translated a tape of imprints of Ukrainian War, as a personal way to support the Ukrainian Victory.\\n\\nEvery work is an artifact of actual actions of what was happening on the territory of my motherland.\\n\\n \\n\\nIt was a two months process with non-stop experimentation with materials and techniques, non-stop processing and reflection through Collaborations with colleagues, each one has unique qualifications, and own strong background of unique culture codes.\\n\\nrealities\\n\\nThe spatial concept of the exhibition has several special realities which embedded in separate open rooms, which together form a common pavilion. The intersection of these territories reflects the complex of incompatible contrasts that humanity endures in the real-time war.\\n\\nпроцес \\n↼\\n⇀\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/830da7_f41aab1d9cfe4ee3bf83b1b6995b1ca6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_720,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/830da7_f41aab1d9cfe4ee3bf83b1b6995b1ca6~mv2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720},{\"src\":\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/830da7_447faa74d54140b9ac3c11cabfb90982~mv2.jpg/v1/fit/w_631,h_415,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/830da7_447faa74d54140b9ac3c11cabfb90982~mv2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"IMG_20221221_001455_168_edited.jpg\",\"title\":\"\",\"width\":630,\"height\":415},{\"src\":\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/830da7_2eaf49cc2dab472aafdfad500ff4936f~mv2.jpg/v1/fit/w_713,h_415,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/830da7_2eaf49cc2dab472aafdfad500ff4936f~mv2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"